## 11. System Workflows

- **Patient:** register/login → request appointment → notified on confirm → view record post-visit.
- **Receptionist:** login → search/register patient → create appointment → update status.
- **Doctor:** login → view appointments → select patient → view history → create/update record.
- **Admin:** login → dashboard → manage users/roles → oversee activity.

---

## 12. Out of Scope / Future Work

Pharmacy management, lab management, billing/insurance, SMS/email notifications, prescription printing, appointment reminders, advanced reporting, ambulance/emergency module, file/document uploads, audit logs, multi-branch support.

